<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<title>DisasterGuard AI - Intelligence</title>

<style>

body {
    font-family: Arial;
    background: #0f172a;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px;
}

.card {
    width: 600px;
    margin: 30px auto;
    background: #1e293b;
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 15px;
}

.chain {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin: 20px;
}

.arrow {
    font-size: 30px;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<h1>🧠 DisasterGuard AI</h1>

<h2>Failure-Chain Intelligence</h2>

<div class="card">

    <div class="chain">
        🌧️ Heavy Rain
    </div>

    <div class="arrow">↓</div>

    <div class="chain">
        💧 Water Accumulation
    </div>

    <div class="arrow">↓</div>

    <div class="chain">
        🌊 Flood Risk
    </div>

    <div class="arrow">↓</div>

    <div class="chain">
        🚧 Road Blockage
    </div>

    <div class="arrow">↓</div>

    <div class="chain">
        🚑 Emergency Response Delay
    </div>

</div>

</body>

</html>